{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:gift:design-schema:requirement-structure-1",
  "title": "gift.requirement-structure/1 composite body — shared TypeTerm and design Value contract",
  "$comment": "Design structure bound to exact content revision; extends the offline finite projection to preserve main shared TypeTerm, generic binders, typed definition values, qualified design expressions, closed constructors and dynamic design use. Old narrow projections require explicit reader selection/migration. Not a production reader. Existence, public access, type/kind, default qualification, pure static phase, role paths, hygiene, integer lexeme preservation and accepted obligations require semantic consumers.",
